<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Choose Version - Omar Nino</title>
<style>
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;height:100%;font-family:Arial;overflow:hidden}
body{
 background: url('luffy.jpg') center/cover no-repeat fixed;
 background-color:#000;
}
#overlay{position:fixed;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.65);z-index:1}
#content{position:relative;z-index:2;width:100%;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;color:#fff}
h1{font-size:42px;color:#00bfff;text-shadow:2px 2px 10px #000;margin-bottom:10px}
p{color:#ddd;margin-bottom:40px}
.versions{display:flex;gap:30px}
.ver{
 width:220px;height:120px;
 background:rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
 border:2px solid gold;
 border-radius:15px;
 display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;
 cursor:pointer;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;
 font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;
 transition:0.2s;
}
.ver:hover{background:gold;color:#000;transform:scale(1.05)}
.ver span{font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;margin-top:8px;color:#aaa}
#shop{position:fixed;right:15px;bottom:15px;z-index:3;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6);color:gold;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="overlay"></div>
<div id="content">
<h1>Choose version</h1>
<p>Select the optimal version to cache and use with the PS4 FW 9.xx host</p>
<div class="versions">
<a class="ver" href="index.html">9.00-9.60<div><span>PSFree + Lapse</span></div></a>
<a class="ver" href="../900/index.html">9.00 Only<div><span>Stable</span></div></a>
</div>
</div>
<div id="shop">صالة عمر نينو - 07701690121</div>
</body>
</html>
